[I] Pulseaudio command line mixer

[T] pamixer is a simple command line mixer for PulseAudio (and PipeWire via its
[T] pulse compatibility layer), useful for volume key bindings in lightweight
[T] window manager setups.

[U] https://github.com/cdemoulins/pamixer

